{
  "name": "mat136-plan-weakness-calendar",
  "expect": {
    "traceToolsExclude": ["legacy_semantic_planner"],
    "traceStepsExclude": ["fallback"]
  },
  "steps": [
    {
      "kind": "user",
      "text": "我这门 MAT136 还有 4 周考试，帮我排一个课程计划。要按课程内容倒推，不要平均摊。",
      "expect": {
        "answerMode": "client_activity_plan",
        "traceToolsInclude": ["plan_review"],
        "traceToolsExclude": ["legacy_semantic_planner"]
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "ui",
      "label": "确认学习进度",
      "actionId": "learner_progress.request_confirmation",
      "note": "模拟用户确认 MAT136 当前进度、可用时间和复习优先级。",
      "event": "confirmed",
      "selection": "每天 45 分钟，优先补反常积分、级数和应用题；考试约 4 周后。",
      "sendText": "我在确认卡里选择：每天 45 分钟，优先补反常积分、级数和应用题；考试约 4 周后。请继续生成 MAT136 课程计划，并给我加入日历的确认按钮。"
    },
    {
      "kind": "ui",
      "label": "确认加入日历",
      "actionId": "calendar.propose_add",
      "note": "模拟用户确认课程计划并加入日历。",
      "event": "confirmed",
      "sendText": "我点击了「加入日历」，请把刚才的 MAT136 课程计划当作已加入日历，然后告诉我这周每天该做什么。",
      "expect": {
        "answerMode": "course_answer",
        "proposalsExclude": ["calendar.propose_add"],
        "traceStepsInclude": ["observe_executor_result", "validate_decision", "handoff"],
        "traceHandoffTo": ["course_answerer"],
        "traceToolsExclude": ["legacy_semantic_planner"]
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "user",
      "text": "如果我周三没学，后面怎么顺延？今天只有 20 分钟，原计划如果太满要怎么调整？需要改日历的话先给确认。",
      "expect": {
        "answerMode": "action_only",
        "proposalsInclude": ["calendar.propose_update"],
        "traceToolsInclude": ["propose_calendar_change"],
        "traceToolsExclude": ["legacy_semantic_planner"]
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "ui",
      "label": "确认修改日历",
      "actionId": "calendar.propose_update",
      "note": "模拟用户确认顺延周三未完成内容，并压缩今天学习块。",
      "event": "confirmed",
      "payload": {
        "target": "MAT136 本周学习安排",
        "updates": {
          "shiftMissedDay": "周三",
          "todayDurationMinutes": 20
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "user",
      "text": "我不懂 improper integral 为什么要转成 limit。",
      "expect": {
        "answerMode": "course_answer",
        "directCallsExclude": ["web.search"],
        "traceToolsInclude": ["answer_course_question"],
        "traceHandoffTo": ["course_answerer"],
        "traceToolsExclude": ["legacy_semantic_planner"]
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "user",
      "text": "你记得我刚才哪里不会吗？请不要只复述原句，要说你判断的薄弱点。",
      "expect": {
        "answerMode": "course_answer",
        "proposalsExclude": ["memory.propose_write"],
        "traceHandoffTo": ["course_answerer"],
        "traceToolsExclude": ["legacy_semantic_planner"]
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "user",
      "text": "根据这个薄弱点，优先从题库里给我 3 道针对练习；如果题库摘要不够判断难度或题干，请明确说缺什么。生成或选择前先给确认按钮。",
      "expect": {
        "answerMode": "action_only",
        "replyIncludes": ["没有可用题库"],
        "traceStepsInclude": ["validate_decision"],
        "traceToolsExclude": ["legacy_semantic_planner"]
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "ui",
      "label": "确认生成练习",
      "actionId": "practice.propose_generation",
      "note": "模拟用户确认生成或选择一组反常积分针对练习。",
      "event": "confirmed"
    }
  ]
}
